sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR
    participant View as "Web View (admin.master.shifts.index)"
    participant C as ShiftController
    participant S as "Shift Model"
    participant WS as "WorkerShift Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Buka halaman Data Master Shift
    View->>C: GET /admin/master/shifts (dengan/without search)

    C->>S: Ambil data shift + worker_shifts_count
    S->>DB: SELECT shifts + COUNT worker_shifts + pagination
    DB-->>S: Hasil query

    alt Data valid
        C-->>View: Render daftar shift
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan list, filter, pagination
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect/back + pesan error
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan error
    end
